Build Bandobast — An Intelligent Event Operations Platform

Act as a senior full-stack engineer, product designer, AI engineer and QA engineer. Build a polished, functional, production-minded web application called **Bandobast** for the PromptWars Challenge 5: Celebration & Event Planner.

Do not stop after proposing a plan, generating wireframes or creating a landing page. Inspect the workspace, establish the architecture, implement the application, run it, test the critical workflows, fix errors and document how to use it.

If the workspace already contains a project, inspect it and preserve useful existing work. If it is empty, initialize the project. Work in manageable stages, but continue implementation without waiting for approval after each stage.

