- Warning: a high-contrast amber treatment
- Error: a clear, accessible red treatment

Use forest olive for primary actions and selected navigation, marigold for celebration-related highlights and important metrics, terracotta for secondary accents, and sage for supportive panels and status indicators.

Maintain readable contrast. Do not use pale text on pale backgrounds or rely on color alone to communicate a status.

### Design language

- Elegant editorial typography with a refined serif for major headings and a clean sans-serif for body text.
